cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "@three-ws/naming-mcp"
abstract: "Resolve Solana .sol names and check *.threews.sol agent-identity availability from any AI agent. sns_resolve maps a .sol name to its owner wallet, sns_reverse maps a wallet to its primary name, and threews_availability checks whether a three.ws agent handle is free to claim. No key, no signer, no payment."
version: 0.1.3
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nirholas/token-naming-mcp"
url: "https://three.ws"
authors:
